WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-Bridge, suspended in a void, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Lyra: Almost... got it!

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:09.900 align:center
Lyra: Mine!

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Precarious ledge at the edge of the collapsing bridge, urgent.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.500 align:center
Echo Shard: Release it. Trash.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.800 align:center
Lyra: Never!

8
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.100 align:center
Lyra: Stay back!

9
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.400 align:center
Echo Shard: Pointless struggle.

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling observation platform overlooking a flickering core memory, dread.

11
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000 align:center
Lyra: Can't… stop. They're coming.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.300 align:center
Kael: Too fragile. This memory...

13
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.600 align:center
Lyra: Who…?

14
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.900 align:center
Kael: Don't lose it. Again.

15
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.200 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Labyrinth of Shifting Memory-Structures, tense.

16
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.500 align:center
Lyra: Dead end. Always a dead end.

17
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.800 align:center
Kael: The resonance... use it.

18
00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.100 align:center
Lyra: How?

19
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.400 align:center
Echo Shard: Obstruction. Remove it.

20
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.700 align:center
Lyra: Like this?

21
00:00:51.1000 --> 00:00:55.1000 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Decaying corridor within the labyrinth, dread.

22
00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:58.300 align:center
Lyra: What was I... doing?

23
00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Irrelevant. Release.

24
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:00.900 align:center
Lyra: No! My name...

25
00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: It is safer this way.

26
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Crumbling chamber, Loom's tendrils reaching, desperate.

27
00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.800 align:center
Lyra: Can't... remember the way out.

28
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.100 align:center
Kael: This feeling... I know it.

29
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.400 align:center
Lyra: My childhood home... gone.

30
00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Yield. Embrace the peace.

31
00:01:18.1000 --> 00:01:23.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Dead-end platform, Loom closing in, dread.

32
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.300 align:center
Lyra: It's too close. No escape.

33
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.600 align:center
Kael: My memory... use it.

34
00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:29.900 align:center
Lyra: But... you'll fade.

35
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.200 align:center
Kael: Better than oblivion. For both.

36
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:39.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The dead-end platform, Loom poised to strike, desperate.

37
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.800 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me, Kael.

38
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Futile.

39
00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.400 align:center
Lyra: Not futile!

40
00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:44.700 align:center
Kael: Remember...

41
00:01:45.1000 --> 00:01:49.1000 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The platform, engulfed in light, desperate.

42
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.300 align:center
Lyra: Kael! No!

43
00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.600 align:center
Lyra: It's too much!

44
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:53.900 align:center
Lyra: He's gone...

45
00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:00.200 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The platform, now silent and empty of Kael's presence, dread.

46
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A temporary disruption.

47
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.800 align:center
Lyra: You... you're still here?

48
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We preserve. By devouring.

49
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your purpose is ours.

50
00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:13.700 align:center
♪ at dawn, in The platform, Loom's presence dominating, dread.

51
00:02:13.1000 --> 00:02:15.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You seek the Chronos Core.

52
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.300 align:center
Lyra: How...?

53
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We know your every step.

54
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:21.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We await you there.
